From: Calcite <calcite@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gpui): radial gradient backgrounds

Adds BackgroundTag::RadialGradient and radial_gradient(). The center and radius reuse unused fields of Background, so the shared quad, shadow, and path shaders gain the gradient in one place and the Metal, wgpu, and Direct3D layouts do not change.

